			description: [
				"The Drilling Machine is a powerful tool. Once you've found a deep vein with your Sample Drill, place this down in the deep vein chunk and power it."
				""
				"These drills are quite &6power hungry&r, so it's recommended you use a decently sized &6Wind Mill&r if you want some meaningful ore production."
