		{
			dependencies: ["5391869C3BF99BCB"]
			description: [
				"I hope you left waypoints at any &6large rocks&r you've found on the surface that contain all those &6precious resources&r, because you'll be needing them right about now."
				""
				"This chapter asks for a LOT of &6Raw Iron&r, and I mean it. This is your best source of that Iron unless you want to build a world eater."
				""
				"Those indicator rocks tell you that there's a &6deep vein&r of that resource in one of its neighbouring chunks. These veins can only be exploited by a Drilling Machine."
