				"If anyone thinks they have suggestions on ways to improve the early-game Nether, &aplease let me know&r! I want it to be somewhere you go back to regularly to do something new in later chapters, and every time you go back there's a way to get around more easily than the last time."
				""
				"Please read the next page of this quest too :P"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Quickfire round:"
				""
				"- The pre-Moon questline is currently &cvery barebones&r. It will be fleshed out with more side content such as &6Backpacks&r in later updates."
				""
				"- Planets will have their own Portaberries nearer to the end of their respective progression focus points."
				""
				"- All Portaberries will be automatable."
				""
				"- Planets will not lose all meaning after obtaining their Portaberry, they'll likely be similar to the Nether where you'll have to &6come back for something new&r that you couldn't do before."
				""
				"- Mining for space metals will be able to &6be done from Earth&r later-game, and I already have an idea for how that will be done."
			]
